{"model":"gpt-6-luna","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"## Output Requirements\n\nRespond with a strict JSON object that matches this JSON Schema:\n\n{\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"x-title\": \"Company\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"name\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"default\": \"\"\n        },\n        \"location\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"default\": \"\"\n        },\n        \"description\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"default\": \"\"\n        },\n        \"minProjectBudget\": {\n            \"type\": \"integer\",\n            \"default\": 0\n        },\n        \"companySize\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"default\": \"\"\n        },\n        \"websiteUrl\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"Remove any tracking parameters from the URL\",\n            \"default\": \"\"\n        },\n        \"clients\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\",\n                \"description\": \"Correctly extract items of type: string\"\n            },\n            \"default\": []\n        }\n    },\n    \"x-php-class\": \"Company\",\n    \"additionalProperties\": false\n}"},{"role":"user","content":"### Acme Labs\n\n<div class=\"location\">New York, NY<\/div><div class=\"description\">Custom Laravel development and modernization services.<\/div><div class=\"budget\">Minimum project size $10,000+<\/div><div class=\"company-size\">10 - 49<\/div> [Website](https:\/\/acme.example.com?utm_source=sample)- Globex\n- Initech\n "}],"max_completion_tokens":1024,"response_format":{"type":"json_object"}}